  "summary": "I'm an enthusiastic and energetic back-end engineer, who is passionate about software and hardware architectures.  My expertise for code quality and proper unit test design lies in Java, Scala, and the C++ languages.\n\nIn my spare time, I work on a web-based Massively Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game (MMORPG) titled \"Cybots\", which utilizes Java Servlet Pages to power its backend.",
